    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 Spaces</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve</p><p>You disassemble a creature into its component parts.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong> and make a <strong>5:1 Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check, resisted by the target's <strong>Resilience</strong>.</p><p>If you succeed, the target's <strong>Body</strong> is reduced by the <strong>1+ ES</strong> where <strong>ES</strong> equals the difference in <strong>successes</strong>. This lasts until the target completes a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</p><p>If the target's <strong>Body</strong> is reduced to <strong>0</strong>, it comes apart where it stands and dies.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.iKSUjxfs67BEzer9]{Deathsinger's Fresh Canvas}</p>",
